== Problem description ==
Nintendo Switch that gets error 2002-2663 when you insert the Game Cartridge.

It will boot up fine with no game inside

== Symptoms ==
* Error 2002-2663
*

== Solution Repair Steps ==

# Try rebooting the game console
# Try a new game reader
# Try reflowing or reballing  IC on the other side of the game cartridge connector
# Otherwise, try replacing it

